abstract: >-
  Independently implemented synthetic payment-risk research with time-aware
  data contracts, comparable models, complete-path pattern replay, selective
  label analysis and deterministic field tools. Synthetic findings are not
  production outcomes or causal business benefits.
keywords:
  - risk modeling
  - reproducible research
  - synthetic data
  - pattern discovery
